{"rc":{"cells":[{"id":"f","type":"txt","x":"0pt","y":"8pt","w":"{parent.w}","h":"-1","maxLines":"8","text":"${@i18n.foot}","fontSize":"11pt","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B"}],"i18n":{"zh-CN":{"foot":"下载、收益和审核来自 App Store Connect，用你自己的密钥只读获取。密钥默认只存在这台设备上，不进备份，随时可以在 App Store Connect 里停用。评分来自 App Store 公开数据。"},"en-US":{"foot":"Downloads, proceeds and review status come from App Store Connect, read-only with your own key. The key stays on this device by default and never goes into backups; you can revoke it anytime in App Store Connect. Ratings come from public App Store data."}}}}
